   115	
   116	| Fact | Source |
   117	|------|--------|
   118	| `claude "<prompt>"` fires the prompt as the first interactive turn, in-band (dialog-safe) | canary |
   119	| `--allowedTools` on the launch silently prevents the positional prompt from firing — never combine them in a launcher | canary (2×2) |
   120	| An agent cannot `/clear` or `/exit` itself; self-SIGTERM trips the safety classifier (exit 143) | canary |
